    calc('D.4', `A flat coil has area $0.040\\,\\mathrm{m^2}$ in a ${val(n*.2,'T')} field. Its normal makes $60^\\circ$ to the field. Find the flux per turn.`,.04*n*.2*.5,'Wb','$\\Phi=BA\\cos60^\\circ$.','HL');
